    "testimonials_DAjwtR": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_HxKRp9": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p>My most recent visit to the store was great . The lady was so nice helpful and accommodating. I purchased my table and chairs and received them at home ( my own transport but IL workmen ) in 1 hour and half . Thank you for being so helpful and kind.</p>",
            "author": "Charlene Wong, Customer"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_VaAYmM": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p>It’s such a nice place and beautifully decorated! Could spend all day there. The staff is super friendly and super helpful! Happy place!</p>",
            "author": "Alexandra Kurmeier, Customer"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_97Yeth": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p>Fantastic and stylish products at amazing price points!  Bought the Isola bar cart which we hope will encourage many wonderful libations!</p>",
            "author": "Melanie Fitzgerald, Customer"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_jPJjnW": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p>Thank you, Hafiz and Jen, for the excellent assistance at the showroom today! Your professionalism and helpfulness made the process so smooth. We’ve just placed our order and are excited to receive our new furniture soon!</p>",
            "author": "Lychee King"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_zfjLTy": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p>Amirah is responsive in getting back to me with the enquiries and thank you for making it possible for me to purchase the items online using the gift cards.</p>",
            "author": "Haizat Said, Customer"
          }
        }
